  "name": "74HC595 shift register",
  "category": "logic",
  "description": "8-bit serial-in, parallel-out shift register with output latches (74HC595): DS shifts in on SHCP rising, STCP rising copies the register to Q0-Q7, OE_N high releases the outputs; Q7S chains to the next device.",
